Build gh for GOOS=wasip1 and reach slicc-kernel for HTTP and commands.

Reason: gh v2.102.0 does not build for wasip1. Unix-only files in gh and in
clipboard, survey, termenv, bubbletea, tcell and in-toto omit wasip1, and
wasip1 has no termios, flock or process spawn. The stubs let the offline
commands compile. internal/slicchost talks to host/gh-host.mjs (gh_host
probe/call/take): go-gh's http.DefaultTransport and run.PrepareCmd send HTTP
and start commands there. git is resolved with slicchost.LookPath because
os/exec.LookPath cannot see slicc commands.

Upstream: not filed (Lars decides).
removeWhen: gh and these modules build for GOOS=wasip1, and wasip1 can dial
and spawn, without this patch.

